  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can invoke your rune magic to protect your allies. When another creature you can see within 60 feet of you is hit by an attack roll, you can take a Reaction to force the attacker to reroll the d20 and use the new roll. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
